            "body": "<!-- devin-review-comment {\"id\": \"ANALYSIS_pr-review-job-1be65645956d480f8767b3dabc07b228_0001\", \"file_path\": \"cmd/sqlc-gen-spira/continued_escape_test.lgo\", \"start_line\": 48, \"end_line\": 51, \"side\": \"RIGHT\", \"kind\": \"analysis\"} -->\n\n🔍 **Continuation tests bypass sqlc preprocessing**\n\n`checkContinuedString` sends fixture SQL straight to the plugin. The test does not exercise the comment and newline handling that precedes plugin execution in `sqlc generate`.\n\n<!-- devin-review-badge-begin -->\n<a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/review/gosuda/spira/pull/47\" target=\"_blank\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-dark.svg?v=4\"><img src=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-light.svg?v=4\" alt=\"Devin Review\"></picture></a>\n<!-- devin-review-badge-end -->\n\n---\n*Was this helpful? React with 👍 or 👎 to provide feedback.*",
